                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                From the table of values, what is the shape of the function \( f(x) = {@f@} \)?
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
