        <generalfeedback format="html">
            <text><![CDATA[
<ol class="HELM_parts">
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                Since \( {@f@}\) can take any value of \(x\) in the given interval \({@leftend@} \leq x\leq {@rightend@}\) , the domain remains as \({@leftend@} \leq x\leq {@rightend@}\).
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                Siden \( {@f@}\) kan ta hvilken som helst \(x\) verdi  i det gitte intervallet \({@leftend@} \leq x\leq {@rightend@}\) , er definisjonsmengden fortsatt \({@leftend@} \leq x\leq {@rightend@}\).
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Da \( {@f@}\) im gegebenen Intervall \({@leftend@} \leq x\leq {@rightend@}\) jeden Wert von \(x\) annehmen kann, bleibt die Definitionsmenge als \( {@leftend@} \leq x\leq {@rightend@}\).
            </span>
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                We fill in the values in the table by substituting the value of \(x\) into the function expression \(f(x) = {@f@}\). Hence:
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                Vi fyller ut verdiene i tabellen ved å substituere \(x\) i funksjonsuttrykket \(f(x) = {@f@}\) med de gitte verdiene. Altså:
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Wir tragen die Werte in die Tabelle ein, indem wir den Wert von \(x\) in die Funktion \(f(x) = {@f@}\) einsetzen. Somit:
            </span>
        </p>
        <p>
            \(f(-1) = {@a@}(-1)^3 = {@ta2@}\),
        </p>
        <p>
            \(f(0) = {@a@}(0)^3 = {@ta3@}\),
        </p>
        <p>
            \(f(1) = {@a@}(1)^3 = {@ta4@}\)
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                and
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                und
            </span>
        </p>
        <p>
            \(f(2) = {@a@}(2)^3 = {@ta5@}\).
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                To find the graph of \(f(x) = {@f@}\), you plot the \(x\) and \(f(x)\) points on a graph and pick the graph that is close to your sketch.
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                For å finne grafen til \(f(x) = {@f@} \), plotter du punktene \(x \) og \(f(x) \) på en graf og velger diagrammet som er nærmest din skisse.
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Um den Graphen von \(f(x) = {@f@}\) zu finden, zeichnen Sie die Punkte \(x\) und \(f(x)\) in einen Graphen und wählen den Graphen aus, der am besten mit Ihrer Skizze übereinstimmt.
            </span>
        </p>
    </li>
    <li>
        <p>
            <span class="multilang" lang="en">
                From table and graph, the smallest value of \(f(x)\) occurs at \(x = 0\) which is \(f(0) = {@ta3@}\) and the biggest value at \(x=-3 \text{ or }3\), \(f(3) = {@fat3@}\), hence the range is \({@ta3@} \leq x\leq {@fat3@}\)
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="no">
                Fra tabell og graf forekommer den minste verdien av \(f(x) \) ved \(x = 0\) som er \(f(0) = {@ta3@} \) og den største verdien forekommer ved \(x = -3 \text{or} 3 \), \(f (3) = {@fat3@} \), derfor er verdiområdet \({@ta3@} \leq x \leq {@fat3@} \)
            </span>
            <span class="multilang" lang="de">
                Aus Tabelle und Grafik ergibt sich der kleinste Wert von \(f(x)\) bei \(x = 0\), was \(f(0) = {@ta3@}\) ist, und der größte Wert bei \(x =-3 \text{ oder }3\), \(f(3) = {@fat3@}\), also ist der Bereich \({@ta3@} \leq x\leq {@fat3@}\)
            </span>
        </p>
    </li>
</ol>
]]></text>
        </generalfeedback>
